*~

# AI tooling (local agent state — except project-level skills, which are
# methodology artefacts and version-controlled with the project).
# Pattern: ignore contents of .claude/ except skills/ subtree. Note `.claude/*`
# (with asterisk) — negation only works when the parent dir isn't fully
# excluded.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**

